h></svg><span><span class="touch-card__label">Authored WhatsApp</span><span class="touch-card__val" dir="ltr">+966 50 000 0000</span><span class="touch-card__note">Authored WhatsApp note.</span></span></a></div><section class="social-strip social-strip--joined"><div class="social-strip__wrap section-wrap"><div class="tag rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>Follow the studio</span></div><h2 class="rv">New work goes up here first.</h2><ul class="social-links"><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://instagram.com/braiinstatiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.2c3.2 0 3.6 0 4.9.07 1.2.05 1.8.25 2.2.42.6.22 1 .48 1.4.9.4.4.7.8.9 1.4.2.4.4 1 .4 2.2.1 1.3.1 1.7.1 4.9s0 3.6-.1 4.9c0 1.2-.2 1.8-.4 2.2a3.7 3.7 0 0 1-.9 1.4c-.4.4-.8.7-1.4.9-.4.2-1 .4-2.2.4-1.3.1-1.7.1-4.9.1s-3.6 0-4.9-.1c-1.2 0-1.8-.2-2.2-.4a3.7 3.7 0 0 1-1.4-.9 3.7 3.7 0 0 1-.9-1.4c-.2-.4-.4-1-.4-2.2C2.2 15.6 2.2 15.2 2.2 12s0-3.6.1-4.9c0-1.2.2-1.8.4-2.2.2-.6.5-1 .9-1.4.4-.4.8-.7 1.4-.9.4-.2 1-.4 2.2-.4C8.4 2.2 8.8 2.2 12 2.2Zm0 1.8c-3.1 0-3.5 0-4.8.07-1.1.05-1.7.24-2.1.4-.5.2-.9.44-1.3.83-.4.4-.63.8-.83 1.3-.16.4-.35 1-.4 2.1C2.5 8.5 2.5 8.9 2.5 12s0 3.5.07 4.8c.05 1.1.24 1.7.4 2.1.2.5.44.9.83 1.3.4.4.8.63 1.3.83.4.16 1 .35 2.1.4 1.3.06 1.7.07 4.8.07s3.5 0 4.8-.07c1.1-.05 1.7-.24 2.1-.4.5-.2.9-.44 1.3-.83.4-.4.63-.8.83-1.3.16-.4.35-1 .4-2.1.06-1.3.07-1.7.07-4.8s0-3.5-.07-4.8c-.05-1.1-.24-1.7-.4-2.1a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-.83-1.3 3.5 3.5 0 0 0-1.3-.83c-.4-.16-1-.35-2.1-.4C15.5 4 15.1 4 12 4Zm0 3.1a4.9 4.9 0 1 1 0 9.8 4.9 4.9 0 0 1 0-9.8Zm0 1.8a3.1 3.1 0 1 0 0 6.2 3.1 3.1 0 0 0 0-6.2Zm5.1-2.1a1.15 1.15 0 1 1 0 2.3 1.15 1.15 0 0 1 0-2.3Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">Instagram</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiinstatiion</span></span></a></li><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://linkedin.com/company/braiin-statiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.98 3.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 5 8.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5ZM3 9.5h4V21H3V9.5Zm6.5 0h3.8v1.6h.05c.53-.95 1.83-1.95 3.77-1.95 4.03 0 4.78 2.5 4.78 5.76V21h-4v-5.3c0-1.27-.02-2.9-1.8-2.9-1.8 0-2.08 1.38-2.08 2.8V21h-4V9.5Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">LinkedIn</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiin-statiion</span></span></a></li><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://behance.net/braiinstatiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8.2 5.5c1.9 0 3.4.85 3.4 2.75 0 1.15-.6 1.9-1.6 2.3 1.4.4 2.1 1.4 2.1 2.8 0 2.3-1.9 3.15-4 3.15H2V5.5h6.2Zm-.4 4.4c.9 0 1.5-.4 1.5-1.25S8.7 7.4 7.75 7.4H4.9v2.5h2.9Zm.2 4.75c1 0 1.7-.45 1.7-1.45s-.65-1.4-1.7-1.4H4.9v2.85h3.1ZM19 9.35c2.3 0 3.7 1.6 3.7 4.05 0 .18-.02.4-.04.6h-5.6c.1 1.2.85 1.85 1.95 1.85.8 0 1.4-.35 1.65-.95h1.9c-.45 1.6-1.75 2.5-3.6 2.5-2.4 0-3.9-1.6-3.9-4 0-2.35 1.55-4.05 3.94-4.05Zm-1.9 3.3h3.6c-.1-1.05-.75-1.7-1.75-1.7-1.05 0-1.7.6-1.85 1.7ZM15.6 6.3h5.2v1.4h-5.2V6.3Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">Behance</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiinstatiion</span></span></a></li><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://youtube.com/@braiinstatiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidd