.4.85 3.4 2.75 0 1.15-.6 1.9-1.6 2.3 1.4.4 2.1 1.4 2.1 2.8 0 2.3-1.9 3.15-4 3.15H2V5.5h6.2Zm-.4 4.4c.9 0 1.5-.4 1.5-1.25S8.7 7.4 7.75 7.4H4.9v2.5h2.9Zm.2 4.75c1 0 1.7-.45 1.7-1.45s-.65-1.4-1.7-1.4H4.9v2.85h3.1ZM19 9.35c2.3 0 3.7 1.6 3.7 4.05 0 .18-.02.4-.04.6h-5.6c.1 1.2.85 1.85 1.95 1.85.8 0 1.4-.35 1.65-.95h1.9c-.45 1.6-1.75 2.5-3.6 2.5-2.4 0-3.9-1.6-3.9-4 0-2.35 1.55-4.05 3.94-4.05Zm-1.9 3.3h3.6c-.1-1.05-.75-1.7-1.75-1.7-1.05 0-1.7.6-1.85 1.7ZM15.6 6.3h5.2v1.4h-5.2V6.3Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">Behance</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiinstatiion</span></span></a></li><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://youtube.com/@braiinstatiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.6 7.2a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.75-1.77C18.3 5 12 5 12 5s-6.3 0-7.85.43A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.4 7.2C2 8.76 2 12 2 12s0 3.24.4 4.8a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 1.75 1.77C5.7 19 12 19 12 19s6.3 0 7.85-.43a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 1.75-1.77C22 15.24 22 12 22 12s0-3.24-.4-4.8ZM10 15.1V8.9l5.2 3.1-5.2 3.1Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">YouTube</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiinstatiion</span></span></a></li></ul></div></section></div></section><section class="faq-section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="tag tag--sky rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>الأسئلة الشائعة</span></div><div class="sec-head"><h2 class="rv" id="faq-heading">أسئلة توصلنا <em>كل أسبوع</em></h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">وش تشمل الهوية البصرية الكاملة؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>الاستراتيجية، واتجاه التسمية إذا احتجته، ونظام شعار متكامل، والخطوط والألوان، والإخراج الفني، ودليل استخدام. تخرج بملفات يقدر فريقك أو أي جهة مستقبلية يشتغلون عليها فعلاً، مو مجلد صور.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">كم اتجاه نشوف؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>اتجاهين أو ثلاثة، وكل واحد منها اتجاه نسعد ببنائه. ما نحشو العرض بخيارات ما نؤمن فيها عشان يبان أكبر.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">كم جولة تعديلات تجي معها؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>جولتان مضمّنتان في كل مرحلة. وإذا احتجت أكثر نحسبها بالساعة، ونخبرك قبل ما يبدأ العداد، لا بعده.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">كم ياخذ المشروع وقت؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>الهوية البصرية عادةً من ستة إلى عشرة أسابيع. الفيلم يعتمد على التصوير. الحملة الاجتماعية ممكن تتحرك في أسبوعين. تستلم جدولاً بتواريخ قبل بداية الشغل، مو بعد ما يتأخر.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">نقدر نطلب خدمة واحدة بس؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>أكيد. خذ واحدة من الثمان والعشرين أو خذها كلها. ما في شيء مربوط ببعضه عشان تكبر الفاتورة.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">تشتغلون مع علامات قائمة أصلاً؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>كثير. أحياناً الجواب إعادة بناء كاملة، وأحياناً مجرد ضبط، وبنقول لك بصراحة أي واحدة تحتاجها حتى لو كان الشغل الأصغر هو الصح.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">بأي لغات تشتغلون؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>العربية والإنجليزية داخل الاستوديو وبشكل أصلي. وأي لغة ثانية عبر شركاء مجرَّبين، ويبقى التنسيق والإخراج الفني عندنا حتى ما تطلع النتيجة وكأنها ترجمة.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">كيف تُحسب الأسعار؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>سعر ثابت للمشروع بعد الاتفاق على النطاق، أو عقد شهري للشغل المستمر. بدون مفاجآت بالساعة في النهاية.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">لمن تعود ملكية الشغل؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>لك أنت. نقل كامل للحقوق عند السداد النهائي، وملفات المصدر مشمولة.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">كيف نبدأ؟</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>أرسل النموذج فوق أو راسلنا مباشرة. يوصلك رد خلال يوم عمل واحد فيه أسئلتنا، ونطاق سعري مبدئي، وموعد للمكالمة.</p></div></details></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`pages, as their routes compose them > contact (en) 1`] = `"<section class="hero hero--banner"><div class="hero__media" data-video-src="/media/showreel.mp4" data-clip-start="6.2" data-clip-end="7.9"></div><div class="hero__inner"><h1 aria-label="Let's make it happen"><span class="word" aria-hidden="true"><span class="letter">L</span><span class="letter">e</span><span class="letter">t</span><span class="letter">&#39;</span><span class="letter">s</span></span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true"><span class="letter">m</span><span class="letter">a</span><span class="letter">k</span><span class="letter">e</span></span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true"><span class="letter">i</span><span class="letter">t</span></span> <span class="word accent" aria-hidden="true"><span class="letter">h</span><span class="letter">a</span><span class="letter">p</span><span class="letter">p</span><span class="letter">e</span><span class="letter">n</span></span></h1><div class="hero__side"><p class="hero__sub">Strategy, creative, and production under one roof. Tell us where you want to go, and we&#39;ll take it from there.</p><a href="#inquiry" class="cta cta--badge cta--klein cta--down hero__cta"><span class="cta__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1v13M3 9l5 5 5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span>Start your project</span></a></div></div></section><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/sections/Hero.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script><section class="contact-inquiry" id="inquiry" aria-labelledby="inquiry-heading"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="tag tag--sky rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>Project inquiry</span></div><div class="sec-head"><h2 class="rv" id="inquiry-heading">Tell us what you&#39;re <em>making</em></h2><p class="rv">The more you give us here, the more useful our first reply is. Budget range and deadline help most.</p></div><form id="contact-form" class="contact-form contact-form--full" data-locale="en" data-kind="project_inquiry" data-err-required="This field is required." data-err-email="Enter a valid email address, like name@company.com." data-err-too-long="This is longer than we can accept." data-err-invalid="Please check this field." novalidate><div class="field"><label for="cf-name">Name</label><input id="cf-name" name="name" type="text" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your full name"></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-email">Email</label><input id="cf-email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com"></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-company">Company</label><input id="cf-company" name="company" type="text" maxlength="120" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Optional"></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-service">What do you need?</label><select id="cf-service" name="service"><option value="" selected>Not sure yet, let&#39;s talk</option><optgroup label="01 Branding"><option value="discipline:branding">Branding, help me choose</option><option value="logo">Logo Design</option><option value="packaging">Packaging</option></optgroup><optgroup label="02 Production"><option value="discipline:production">Production, help me choose</option><option value="animation">Animation</option></optgroup></select></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-budget">Budget range</label><select id="cf-budget" name="budget"><option value="">Prefer to discuss</option><option value="lt_25k">Under 25k SAR</option><option value="25k_75k">25k to 75k SAR</option><option value="75k_200k">75k to 200k SAR</option><option value="gt_200k">200k SAR and up</option><option value="not_sure">Not sure yet</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-deadline">When do you need it?</label><input id="cf-deadline" name="deadline" type="text" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off" placeholder="A date, a season, or ASAP"></div><div class="field field-full"><label for="cf-message">Tell us about the project</label><textarea id="cf-message" name="message" required maxlength="5000" placeholder="What are you making, who is it for, and when does it need to be ready?"></textarea></div><div class="field field-full field-check"><input id="cf-consent" name="consent" type="checkbox"><label for="cf-consent">I agree to be contacted about my inquiry.</label></div><div class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true"><label for="cf-hp">Leave this field empty</label><input id="cf-hp" name="hp" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><div class="contact-form__foot field-full"><button type="submit" class="cta cta--badge cta--klein cta--go"><span class="cta__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M2 8h12M9 3l5 5-5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span>Send a message</span></button><p class="contact-form__note">We read everything and reply within one business day.</p></div><p id="contact-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden data-sending="Sending…" data-ok="Got it. We'll be in touch within one business day." data-invalid="Please correct the marked fields and try again." data-rate-limited="Too many attempts. Please wait a minute and try again." data-unavailable="The form isn’t live yet — please email hello@braiinstatiion.com." data-error="Something went wrong. Please try again."></p></form><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/ContactForm.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script></div></section><section class="contact-touch" aria-labelledby="touch-heading"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="tag rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>Stay in touch</span></div><div class="sec-head"><h2 class="rv" id="touch-heading">Talk to <em>us</em></h2><p class="rv">No form, no gatekeeping. Write to us directly and you&#39;ll get a person, not a ticket number.</p></div><div class="contact-touch__grid"><a class="touch-card rv" href="mailto:hello@braiinstatiion.com" data-track="email"><svg class="touch-card__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5.5h18c.55 0 1 .45 1 1v11c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H3c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-11c0-.55.45-1 1-1Zm1.6 2L12 12.6l7.4-5.1H4.6ZM4 9.3v7.2h16V9.3l-7.43 5.13a1 1 0 0 1-1.14 0L4 9.3Z"></path></svg><span><span class="touch-card__label">Email</span><span class="touch-card__val" dir="ltr">hello@braiinstatiion.com</span><span class="touch-card__note">Best for briefs, scopes, and anything with attachments.</span></span></a><a class="touch-card rv" href="https://wa.me/966500000000" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-track="whatsapp"><svg class="touch-card__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.04 2c-5.5 0-9.96 4.46-9.96 9.96 0 1.76.46 3.48 1.34 5L2 22l5.18-1.36a9.93 9.93 0 0 0 4.86 1.24h.01c5.5 0 9.96-4.46 9.96-9.96 0-2.66-1.04-5.16-2.92-7.04A9.88 9.88 0 0 0 12.04 2Zm0 1.84c2.17 0 4.2.85 5.74 2.38a8.07 8.07 0 0 1 2.38 5.74c0 4.48-3.64 8.12-8.12 8.12a8.1 8.1 0 0 1-4.13-1.13l-.3-.18-3.07.8.82-3-.19-.31a8.07 8.07 0 0 1-1.24-4.3c0-4.48 3.64-8.12 8.11-8.12Zm-3.1 4.3c-.16 0-.42.06-.64.3-.22.24-.84.82-.84 2s.86 2.32.98 2.48c.12.16 1.68 2.68 4.14 3.66.58.24 1.03.38 1.38.5.58.18 1.11.16 1.53.1.47-.07 1.44-.59 1.64-1.16.2-.57.2-1.06.14-1.16-.06-.1-.22-.16-.46-.28-.24-.12-1.44-.71-1.66-.79-.22-.08-.38-.12-.54.12-.16.24-.62.79-.76.95-.14.16-.28.18-.52.06-.24-.12-1.02-.38-1.95-1.2-.72-.64-1.2-1.44-1.35-1.68-.14-.24-.01-.37.11-.49.11-.11.24-.28.36-.42.12-.14.16-.24.24-.4.08-.16.04-.3-.02-.42-.06-.12-.53-1.32-.73-1.8-.19-.47-.39-.4-.53-.41h-.46Z"></path></svg><span><span class="touch-card__label">WhatsApp</span><span class="touch-card__val" dir="ltr">+966 50 000 0000</span><span class="touch-card__note">Fastest for quick questions and timing checks.</span></span></a></div><section class="social-strip social-strip--joined"><div class="social-strip__wrap section-wrap"><div class="tag rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>Follow the studio</span></div><h2 class="rv">New work goes up here first.</h2><ul class="social-links"><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://instagram.com/braiinstatiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.2c3.2 0 3.6 0 4.9.07 1.2.05 1.8.25 2.2.42.6.22 1 .48 1.4.9.4.4.7.8.9 1.4.2.4.4 1 .4 2.2.1 1.3.1 1.7.1 4.9s0 3.6-.1 4.9c0 1.2-.2 1.8-.4 2.2a3.7 3.7 0 0 1-.9 1.4c-.4.4-.8.7-1.4.9-.4.2-1 .4-2.2.4-1.3.1-1.7.1-4.9.1s-3.6 0-4.9-.1c-1.2 0-1.8-.2-2.2-.4a3.7 3.7 0 0 1-1.4-.9 3.7 3.7 0 0 1-.9-1.4c-.2-.4-.4-1-.4-2.2C2.2 15.6 2.2 15.2 2.2 12s0-3.6.1-4.9c0-1.2.2-1.8.4-2.2.2-.6.5-1 .9-1.4.4-.4.8-.7 1.4-.9.4-.2 1-.4 2.2-.4C8.4 2.2 8.8 2.2 12 2.2Zm0 1.8c-3.1 0-3.5 0-4.8.07-1.1.05-1.7.24-2.1.4-.5.2-.9.44-1.3.83-.4.4-.63.8-.83 1.3-.16.4-.35 1-.4 2.1C2.5 8.5 2.5 8.9 2.5 12s0 3.5.07 4.8c.05 1.1.24 1.7.4 2.1.2.5.44.9.83 1.3.4.4.8.63 1.3.83.4.16 1 .35 2.1.4 1.3.06 1.7.07 4.8.07s3.5 0 4.8-.07c1.1-.05 1.7-.24 2.1-.4.5-.2.9-.44 1.3-.83.4-.4.63-.8.83-1.3.16-.4.35-1 .4-2.1.06-1.3.07-1.7.07-4.8s0-3.5-.07-4.8c-.05-1.1-.24-1.7-.4-2.1a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-.83-1.3 3.5 3.5 0 0 0-1.3-.83c-.4-.16-1-.35-2.1-.4C15.5 4 15.1 4 12 4Zm0 3.1a4.9 4.9 0 1 1 0 9.8 4.9 4.9 0 0 1 0-9.8Zm0 1.8a3.1 3.1 0 1 0 0 6.2 3.1 3.1 0 0 0 0-6.2Zm5.1-2.1a1.15 1.15 0 1 1 0 2.3 1.15 1.15 0 0 1 0-2.3Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">Instagram</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiinstatiion</span></span></a></li><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://linkedin.com/company/braiin-statiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.98 3.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 5 8.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5ZM3 9.5h4V21H3V9.5Zm6.5 0h3.8v1.6h.05c.53-.95 1.83-1.95 3.77-1.95 4.03 0 4.78 2.5 4.78 5.76V21h-4v-5.3c0-1.27-.02-2.9-1.8-2.9-1.8 0-2.08 1.38-2.08 2.8V21h-4V9.5Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">LinkedIn</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiin-statiion</span></span></a></li><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://behance.net/braiinstatiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8.2 5.5c1.9 0 3.4.85 3.4 2.75 0 1.15-.6 1.9-1.6 2.3 1.4.4 2.1 1.4 2.1 2.8 0 2.3-1.9 3.15-4 3.15H2V5.5h6.2Zm-.4 4.4c.9 0 1.5-.4 1.5-1.25S8.7 7.4 7.75 7.4H4.9v2.5h2.9Zm.2 4.75c1 0 1.7-.45 1.7-1.45s-.65-1.4-1.7-1.4H4.9v2.85h3.1ZM19 9.35c2.3 0 3.7 1.6 3.7 4.05 0 .18-.02.4-.04.6h-5.6c.1 1.2.85 1.85 1.95 1.85.8 0 1.4-.35 1.65-.95h1.9c-.45 1.6-1.75 2.5-3.6 2.5-2.4 0-3.9-1.6-3.9-4 0-2.35 1.55-4.05 3.94-4.05Zm-1.9 3.3h3.6c-.1-1.05-.75-1.7-1.75-1.7-1.05 0-1.7.6-1.85 1.7ZM15.6 6.3h5.2v1.4h-5.2V6.3Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">Behance</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiinstatiion</span></span></a></li><li><a class="sbox rv" href="https://youtube.com/@braiinstatiion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="sbox__top"><svg class="sbox__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.6 7.2a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.75-1.77C18.3 5 12 5 12 5s-6.3 0-7.85.43A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.4 7.2C2 8.76 2 12 2 12s0 3.24.4 4.8a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 1.75 1.77C5.7 19 12 19 12 19s6.3 0 7.85-.43a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 1.75-1.77C22 15.24 22 12 22 12s0-3.24-.4-4.8ZM10 15.1V8.9l5.2 3.1-5.2 3.1Z"></path></svg><svg class="sbox__go" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M6 4h6v6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span><span class="sbox__name">YouTube</span><span class="sbox__user" dir="ltr">@braiinstatiion</span></span></a></li></ul></div></section></div></section><section class="faq-section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="tag tag--sky rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>FAQ</span></div><div class="sec-head"><h2 class="rv" id="faq-heading">Questions we get <em>every week</em></h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">What does a full brand identity include?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>Strategy, naming direction if you need it, a logo system, type and colour, art direction, and a usage guide. You leave with files your own team and any future vendor can actually work from, not a folder of JPEGs.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">How many concepts do we see?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>Two or three routes, and every one of them is a direction we would be happy to build. We don&#39;t pad a presentation with options we don&#39;t believe in just to make the deck look fuller.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">How many rounds of revisions come with that?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>Two rounds are built into every stage. If you want more we bill by the hour, and we tell you before the clock starts, never after.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">How long does a project take?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>A brand identity usually runs six to ten weeks. A film depends on the shoot. A social campaign can move in two. You get a dated schedule before the work starts, not once it&#39;s already late.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">Can we hire you for just one service?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>Yes. Take one of the twenty-eight or take all of them. Nothing is bundled together to force a bigger invoice.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">Do you work with brands that already exist?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>Often. Sometimes the answer is a full rebuild and sometimes it&#39;s a tune-up, and we&#39;ll tell you honestly which one you need even when the smaller job is the right call.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">What languages do you work in?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>Arabic and English are handled natively in house. Anything else runs through partners we&#39;ve vetted, with our team still owning the typesetting and art direction so the result doesn&#39;t read like a translation.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">How is pricing structured?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>A fixed price per project once the scope is agreed, or a monthly retainer for ongoing work. No hourly surprises at the end.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">Who owns the finished work?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>You do. Full rights transfer on final payment, source files included.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item rv" name="faq"><summary class="faq-item__q"><span class="faq-item__t">How do we get started?</span><span class="faq-item__i" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-item__a"><p>Send the form above or email us directly. You&#39;ll get a reply within one business day with our questions, a rough range, and a time to talk.</p></div></details></div></div></section>"`;

